    {
      "subId": "7050605",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Lisa and Jean",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7050602",
      "subQuestName": "Mix Lisa the specified drink",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705060201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705060201": {
            "id": "705060201",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Mmm... The sweetness is just right. Very good.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060202"
            ]
          },
          "705060202": {
            "id": "705060202",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "The coffee is strong and rich with just a nice hint of bitterness to it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060203"
            ]
          },
          "705060203": {
            "id": "705060203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm glad you both like the drinks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060204"
            ]
          },
          "705060204": {
            "id": "705060204",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Actually, I do understand what you meant, Lisa.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060205"
            ]
          },
          "705060205": {
            "id": "705060205",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060206"
            ]
          },
          "705060206": {
            "id": "705060206",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I've been reflecting on my weaknesses lately. There's still room for me to improve in many areas, such as my productivity and management...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060207"
            ]
          },
          "705060207": {
            "id": "705060207",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I'm concerned my stress may even be starting to somehow affect you as well...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060208"
            ]
          },
          "705060208": {
            "id": "705060208",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I think you still don't quite understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060209"
            ]
          },
          "705060209": {
            "id": "705060209",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "What?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060210"
            ]
          },
          "705060210": {
            "id": "705060210",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Hehe. See? Cutie knows.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060211"
            ]
          },
          "705060211": {
            "id": "705060211",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "You were working yourself way too hard, so I thought I'd take you out for some drinks. All I wanted was for you to have some fun.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060212"
            ]
          },
          "705060212": {
            "id": "705060212",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "But even in the tavern, you're still thinking about work. That's what's most concerning.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060213"
            ]
          },
          "705060213": {
            "id": "705060213",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "If you're constantly under stress like this, it's only a matter of time before you burn out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060214"
            ]
          },
          "705060214": {
            "id": "705060214",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Exactly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060215"
            ]
          },
          "705060215": {
            "id": "705060215",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "#Oh... You also agree with Lisa, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060216"
            ]
          },
          "705060216": {
            "id": "705060216",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Hmm, so... is learning to relax actually my biggest challenge?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060217"
            ]
          },
          "705060217": {
            "id": "705060217",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "To quote a saying from Liyue: \"Everything has a balance.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060218"
            ]
          },
          "705060218": {
            "id": "705060218",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yep! Work hard, play hard, and rest even harder. The two of you may need even more rest than you'd expect!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060219"
            ]
          },
          "705060219": {
            "id": "705060219",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That's an... interesting way to put it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060220"
            ]
          },
          "705060220": {
            "id": "705060220",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Hehe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060221"
            ]
          },
          "705060221": {
            "id": "705060221",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Alright, I... I understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060222"
            ]
          },
          "705060222": {
            "id": "705060222",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Thank you, all of you. Now I know that this place serves refreshments for both the body and the mind. Is that why you and Kaeya like the tavern so much?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060223"
            ]
          },
          "705060223": {
            "id": "705060223",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Yes, and no. It really depends on who's making the drinks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060224"
            ]
          },
          "705060224": {
            "id": "705060224",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Speaking of which, we couldn't have changed Jean's mind without you today. You sure have a way with words, Cutie.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060227"
            ]
          },
          "705060227": {
            "id": "705060227",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Hehe, then we'll see you later.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060228"
            ]
          },
          "705060228": {
            "id": "705060228",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I'll consider coming here to relax if I have another opportunity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705060229"
            ]
          },
          "705060229": {
            "id": "705060229",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sounds great. Take care, you two!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
